   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHAT THE LLM ACTUALLY RECEIVES\nThe transcript, and a list of options. That is all.\nNo name · no phone number · no district · no caste marker.\nOpenRouter (cheap, swappable) for the common case;\nSarvam-M as the one-config-value sovereign switch for the jury.",
   "originalText": "WHAT THE LLM ACTUALLY RECEIVES\nThe transcript, and a list of options. That is all.\nNo name · no phone number · no district · no caste marker.\nOpenRouter (cheap, swappable) for the common case;\nSarvam-M as the one-config-value sovereign switch for the jury.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "llm_n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
