   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3.  PROFILE — per field: value, confidence, method (DTMF|LEXICON|REGEX|LLM), asr_engine, confirmed_at.\nraw_transcript is ERASED AT CONFIRM — a Postgres CHECK makes it impossible to keep. Audio was already gone.\n\"We keep neither the voice nor the words, only the confirmed answer.\"",
   "originalText": "3.  PROFILE — per field: value, confidence, method (DTMF|LEXICON|REGEX|LLM), asr_engine, confirmed_at.\nraw_transcript is ERASED AT CONFIRM — a Postgres CHECK makes it impossible to keep. Audio was already gone.\n\"We keep neither the voice nor the words, only the confirmed answer.\"",
