   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BASIC ISSUE 2 — IDENTIFICATION &\nFINANCIAL LINKAGE\n· Verified beneficiary register\n· Consent register — every row carries the\n  script_version the person actually heard\n· Financial-literacy module flag (compulsory\n  in every course, Ch.3 ¶7A.a.iv)\n· ₹50,000 asset-grant eligibility flag",
   "originalText": "BASIC ISSUE 2 — IDENTIFICATION &\nFINANCIAL LINKAGE\n· Verified beneficiary register\n· Consent register — every row carries the\n  script_version the person actually heard\n· Financial-literacy module flag (compulsory\n  in every course, Ch.3 ¶7A.a.iv)\n· ₹50,000 asset-grant eligibility flag",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
