   "text": "BASIC ISSUE 4 — CONVERGENCE\nBatch export: \"240 people in this block\nwant and are eligible for QP AGR/Q1201\"\n→ SSDM · DSC · NSFDC / NSKFDC ·\n  training partners\n+ PM-DAKSH routing counts\nPer-district, per-project, per-beneficiary.",
   "originalText": "BASIC ISSUE 4 — CONVERGENCE\nBatch export: \"240 people in this block\nwant and are eligible for QP AGR/Q1201\"\n→ SSDM · DSC · NSFDC / NSKFDC ·\n  training partners\n+ PM-DAKSH routing counts\nPer-district, per-project, per-beneficiary.",
