   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "· NQR official export — 2,814 rows, sha-stamped.\n  Fields the source omits are NULL, never guessed.\n  NO INVENTED QP CODES, EVER. Prototype rows carry\n  qp_code = NULL and the UI says so in amber.\n· NSQF 2023 entry table — typed by hand, <100 rows.\n  This IS the eligibility engine.\n· NCO-2015 is a SIGNAL ONLY — NCVET found 156 of\n  2,157 mis-mapped and 256 unmappable.\n· Opportunity rows carry source + source_date or\n  are excluded from the Perspective Plan export.",
   "originalText": "· NQR official export — 2,814 rows, sha-stamped.\n  Fields the source omits are NULL, never guessed.\n  NO INVENTED QP CODES, EVER. Prototype rows carry\n  qp_code = NULL and the UI says so in amber.\n· NSQF 2023 entry table — typed by hand, <100 rows.\n  This IS the eligibility engine.\n· NCO-2015 is a SIGNAL ONLY — NCVET found 156 of\n  2,157 mis-mapped and 256 unmappable.\n· Opportunity rows carry source + source_date or\n  are excluded from the Perspective Plan export.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
